e opportunities. Additionally, you can get to try the very popular [https://www.mandarinoriental.com/abu-dhabi/emirates-palace/fine-dining/pastry-shop/cake-shop/le-cafe Palace Cappuccino], ","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Abu Dhabi","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b2/Emirates_palace_from_top_view.jpg","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b2/Emirates_palace_from_top_view.jpg","w":1200,"h":2133,"author":"Abhishek Ajoy Menon","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Emirates_palace_from_top_view.jpg"}},{"id":"abu_dhabi_qasr_al_hosn","areaId":"abu_dhabi","name":"Qasr al-Hosn","category":"monument","tags":["history","photo","views"],"location":{"lat":24.48239,"lng":54.35482},"visitMinutes":120,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"abu_dhabi_qasr_al_hosn","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://qasralhosn.ae/","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":30,"commonsNearby":15,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-19"},"hashtags":["qasralhosn","abudhabi"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"morning","summary":"The oldest stone building in Abu Dhabi, this small fort was first constructed in 1761 and served as the royal palace from the late 18th century until 1966. The site can be visited: the ticket allows you to visit the fort itself, the Cultural Foundation, the House of Artisans and enjoy the Bait Al Gahwa (traditional preparation of Arabic coffee).","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Abu Dhabi","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/AlHosn04.JPG/1280px-AlHosn04.JPG","thumb":"https://thumb